      "cooked": "<p>Just a general note for people not on Discord that we’ve finally gotten around to updating the wiki to include the released DE content.</p>\n<p>A useful example page is <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Harpy\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Harpy</a>. It has Definitive Edition hero character cards for The Harpy, the content of the hero deck, the Villain Character cards, Event cards, and Villain deck content for The Matriarch. New Heroes/Villains/Environments have also been added to the associated list pages.</p>\n<p>I haven’t <em>removed</em> EE content, but as the Definitive Edition is the version of the game that’s in print I’ve had things shuffle DE content to the forefront when it exists. Both the core box and Rook City Renegades content has been included.</p>",
