      "raw": "[quote=\"WalkingTarget, post:3, topic:31227\"]\nSo, I’m falling farther behind on podcasts again\n[/quote]\nYeah, this is why I wish we could find another programmer to step up. :/\n\nLynkfox did the existing character layout to begin with, and I struggled with overhauling it because I'm not a programmer by nature and it's really complex. The Podcasts section and other stuff like the Cover Gallery was easier for me to do because that original layout I could just toss out entirely and rebuild from scratch.\n\nBut the character layout I think the wiki really needs to finally update to Lua to pull it off to get it really looking good, though this at least gets the info on there in some fashion.",
